cff-version: 1.2.0
title: RVQ Artifact Remover - offline removal of neural-codec quantization artifacts from AI-generated music
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the
  metadata from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - name: leckminartor
version: 0.1.2
date-released: "2026-09-17"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/leckminartor/rvq-artifact-remover"
abstract: >-
  Offline deep-processing tool that removes the structured,
  repeatable artifacts introduced by Residual Vector Quantization
  (RVQ) in AI-generated music (EnCodec, SoundStream, DAC, X-Codec).
  Comb-ripple flattening, frozen-noise unfreezing, transient
  restoration, adaptive air-band roll-off and an optional Demucs
  neural separation stage.
keywords:
  - audio
  - audio-restoration
  - ai-music
  - rvq
  - neural-codec
  - demucs
